{"seq":3,"slug":"lot-master-sync-supplier-batch-mapping","title":"批次主数据同步、供应商批次映射与效期字段异常","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/lot-batch-expiry-fefo-traceability-management/lot-expiry-data-model/lot-master-sync-supplier-batch-mapping","wordCount":2733,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"批次主数据同步-供应商批次映射与效期字段异常\">批次主数据同步、供应商批次映射与效期字段异常</h1><p>一批从供应商 A 到货的 5000 件婴幼儿奶粉，会同时带来三串「批号」：供应商送货单写 <code>A24F07</code>，工厂装箱单写 <code>20240715-A</code>，GS1 DataMatrix 里编码的是 AI <code>(10)</code> 下的 <code>L240715A</code>。而 WMS 在收货那一刻必须为这同一批货生成一个内部 <code>lot_id</code>。没有哪一方能保证这三串字符串可以自动对上——它们既不是同一个主键，格式也不同。跨境电商批次主数据工程的真正难题，从来不是「怎么存一个批号」，而是<strong>在没有共享主键的多方之间，把三套各自成立的标识收敛到一个稳定的内部键</strong>，并让从它派生的效期字段不出错。本文聚焦这条同步与映射链路，以及效期字段最常见的几类脏数据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-批次主数据同步是一张别名表-不是一次赋值\">核心概念：批次主数据同步是一张别名表，不是一次赋值</h2><p>批次主数据同步的本质，是建一张<strong>多对一的别名映射表（alias table）</strong>，把各方各自的语言翻译成内部唯一的 <code>canonical lot</code>。供应商按发货批次编号，制造商按生产工单编号，GS1 标准用 AI <code>(10)</code> 的 20 位字母数字批号字段（GS1 General Specifications 规定 AI <code>(10)</code> 为可变长、最多 20 位），欧盟药品的 DataMatrix 里 <code>(10)</code> 还要与随机序列号、<code>(17)</code> 效期一起构成唯一标识（EU Delegated Regulation 2016/161）。<strong>内部 <code>lot_id</code> 是你唯一可控、稳定、与外部解耦的主键</strong>，其余全是它的别名。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;供应商送货单批号&lt;br/&gt;supplier_lot_no&quot;] --&gt; M&#10;  B[&quot;制造商生产批号&lt;br/&gt;mfr_lot_no (GS1 AI 10)&quot;] --&gt; M&#10;  C[&quot;收货 PO / 装箱单号&lt;br/&gt;packing_list_ref&quot;] --&gt; M&#10;  M[&quot;别名解析与规范化&lt;br/&gt;canonicalization + alias table&quot;] --&gt; L[&quot;内部 canonical lot_id&lt;br/&gt;全局唯一、外部解耦&quot;]&#10;  L --&gt; E[&quot;效期字段&lt;br/&gt;date_basis / expiry / shelf_life&quot;]&#10;  L --&gt; T[&quot;追溯与召回&lt;br/&gt;EPCIS / 台账流水&quot;]&#10;  L --&gt; F[&quot;FEFO 可分配池&quot;]&#10;  X[&quot;字段异常&lt;br/&gt;日期歧义 / 缺位 / 冲突&quot;] --&gt; V{准入校验闸门}&#10;  V -- 通过 --&gt; L&#10;  V -- 拒绝 --&gt; Q[&quot;隔离区 QC_HOLD&lt;br/&gt;人工裁决&quot;]\">graph TD\n  A[\"供应商送货单批号&lt;br/&gt;supplier_lot_no\"] --&gt; M\n  B[\"制造商生产批号&lt;br/&gt;mfr_lot_no (GS1 AI 10)\"] --&gt; M\n  C[\"收货 PO / 装箱单号&lt;br/&gt;packing_list_ref\"] --&gt; M\n  M[\"别名解析与规范化&lt;br/&gt;canonicalization + alias table\"] --&gt; L[\"内部 canonical lot_id&lt;br/&gt;全局唯一、外部解耦\"]\n  L --&gt; E[\"效期字段&lt;br/&gt;date_basis / expiry / shelf_life\"]\n  L --&gt; T[\"追溯与召回&lt;br/&gt;EPCIS / 台账流水\"]\n  L --&gt; F[\"FEFO 可分配池\"]\n  X[\"字段异常&lt;br/&gt;日期歧义 / 缺位 / 冲突\"] --&gt; V{准入校验闸门}\n  V -- 通过 --&gt; L\n  V -- 拒绝 --&gt; Q[\"隔离区 QC_HOLD&lt;br/&gt;人工裁决\"]</pre><p>映射关系有四种基本形态，必须显式区分，否则召回时会把不该冻结的货一起冻住，或漏掉真正相关的一批：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>映射形态</th>\n<th>业务场景</th>\n<th>内部建模</th>\n<th>典型风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1:1</td>\n<td>一批一码，正常到货</td>\n<td>一条 alias 指向一个 lot_id</td>\n<td>低；格式漂移会造成重复 lot</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>N:1（合并）</td>\n<td>供应商多个小批合并为一次发运</td>\n<td>多个 alias 指向同一 lot_id</td>\n<td>效期必须取<strong>最早</strong>到期者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1:N（拆分）</td>\n<td>一批货分拨到多个海外仓/多张 PO</td>\n<td>一个 alias 展开为多个 lot_id（带仓维度）</td>\n<td>全批次召回的传播面被低估</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冲突</td>\n<td>同一 alias 在不同单据上含义不同</td>\n<td>人工裁决并留裁决记录</td>\n<td>污染 FEFO 排序与追溯链</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>图中 <code>canonical lot_id</code> 刻意「外部解耦」：它不嵌入任何外部批号字符串，因此供应商改编号规则时改的是 alias 表，而非已入库的历史台账。这与批次库存的四元组台账（<code>lot_id + location_id + qty + status</code>）配合，才能让召回冻结、FEFO 拣选建立在一个不随外部抖动而变的主键上，详见同章节的 <a href=\"lot-level-inventory-ledger-location\">批次级库存台账与库位映射</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"供应商批号到自有批号的映射模型\">供应商批号到自有批号的映射模型</h2><p>别名表的结构决定了整套系统的可维护性。一条可用的 alias 记录至少要携带「来源方 + 来源单号 + 外部批号 + 生效时间窗 + 置信度」，而非简单存两列字符串：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>举例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>alias_id</code></td>\n<td>别名记录主键</td>\n<td><code>al_9f12</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>party_type</code> / <code>party_id</code></td>\n<td>来源方与主体（supplier / mfr / 3pl）</td>\n<td><code>supplier</code> / <code>SUP-A</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>source_ref</code></td>\n<td>承载该批号的单据号</td>\n<td><code>ASN-2026-0187</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>external_lot_raw</code></td>\n<td>原始外部批号（<strong>原样保留，绝不归一化后覆盖</strong>）</td>\n<td><code>A24F07</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>external_lot_norm</code></td>\n<td>规范化后的比对键</td>\n<td><code>a24f07</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>canonical_lot_id</code></td>\n<td>指向内部批次</td>\n<td><code>lot_5c81</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>valid_from</code> / <code>valid_to</code></td>\n<td>该映射的生效窗口</td>\n<td><code>2026-07-15</code> / <code>2027-07-14</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>confidence</code></td>\n<td>映射来源可信度（自动 / 人工确认）</td>\n<td><code>auto</code> / <code>confirmed</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>same_lot</mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mtext>norm</mtext><mi>a</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mtext>norm</mtext><mi>b</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∧</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mtext>gtin</mtext><mi>a</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mtext>gtin</mtext><mi>b</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∧</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mtext>expiry</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mtext>expiry</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>tol</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{same\\_lot} \\iff (\\text{norm}_a = \\text{norm}_b) \\wedge (\\text{gtin}_a = \\text{gtin}_b) \\wedge |d_{\\text{expiry},a} - d_{\\text{expiry},b}| \\le \\Delta_{\\text{tol}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">same_lot</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">norm</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">norm</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">gtin</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0573em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">gtin</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">expiry</span></span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">expiry</span></span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">tol</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>tol</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_{\\text{tol}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">tol</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是效期相容容差（常见取 0 或 1 天）。加上效期这一维，是为了拦住「供应商复用同一批号字符串、但对应不同生产周期」这类真实冲突——只比对字符串会把它错误合并。</p>\n<p><strong>合并与拆分要有守恒约束。</strong> N 个供应商别名合并成一个内部批次时，合并批次效期须取组内最小值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>d</mi><mtext>expiry</mtext><mtext>merged</mtext></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mtext>expiry</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{\\text{expiry}}^{\\text{merged}} = \\min_i d_{\\text{expiry},i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3858em;vertical-align:-0.4188em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.967em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4173em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">expiry</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">merged</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4188em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">expiry</span></span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，否则 FEFO 会把先到期的货排到后面。反之一个别名拆成多个 <code>lot_id</code>（分仓）时，各拆分批次的效期之和与数量之和必须与原始批次守恒，这是召回传播面计算的输入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"批次主数据的同步通道与幂等对齐\">批次主数据的同步通道与幂等对齐</h2><p>同步通道通常有三条：<strong>拉取式</strong>（定时从供应商门户或 ERP 接口拉 ASN/装箱单）、<strong>推送式</strong>（供应商按 EDI 856 ASN 或 EANCOM DESADV 报文推送）、<strong>主数据通道</strong>（GS1 GDSN 同步商品级主数据）。三条通道的字段完备度与实时性不同，必须约定权威源。实践中的优先级一般是：GS1 DataMatrix 扫描值 &gt; 制造厂 EDI 报文 &gt; 供应商门户手工录入，冲突时按此顺序裁决并记录被否决的值。</p>\n<p>EDI 通道里，批次与效期常被混在数量段里，需显式拆解：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>报文/标准</th>\n<th>批号承载</th>\n<th>效期承载</th>\n<th>注意</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>X12 856 (ASN)</td>\n<td><code>LIN</code> 下的 <code>SN1</code> 或 <code>REF</code></td>\n<td><code>DTM*036</code>（Expiration）/ <code>DTM*361</code></td>\n<td>036 是过期日、361 是最佳食用期，混用会错</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EANCOM DESADV</td>\n<td><code>LIN</code> 下的 <code>GIN</code>（批号）</td>\n<td><code>DTM+36</code> / <code>DTM+361</code></td>\n<td>GS1 日期限定符决定语义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GS1 EPCIS 事件</td>\n<td><code>ObjectEvent</code> 的 <code>lotNumber</code></td>\n<td><code>expirationDate</code></td>\n<td>EPCIS 2.0 与 CBV 2.0 于 2022 年 6 月由 GS1 批准</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>幂等是同步的生命线。</strong> 同一份 ASN 会被重推、补推、部分重推，因此写入必须按业务唯一键 upsert，而非 append。推荐的自然唯一键是 <code>(party_id, external_lot_norm, gtin, valid_from)</code>：命中则更新、未命中则插入，并把「这次更新是否改变了效期」作为审计事件落进流水账。若实现成无脑插入，一次重推就造出重复批次，FEFO 可分配池数量随之翻倍——这是批次系统最典型的线上事故。</p>\n<h2 id=\"效期字段的异常谱系\">效期字段的异常谱系</h2><p>效期字段的脏数据比批号字段更致命，因为 FEFO 排序、保质期预警、召回判定全部依赖它。以下五类异常在跨境场景高频出现，每类都能单独造成误判：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>异常类别</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n<th>根因</th>\n<th>后果与对策</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>语义混淆</td>\n<td>AI <code>(17)</code> 过期日被当成 <code>(15)</code> 最佳食用期</td>\n<td>两者都是 6 位日期，标准不同</td>\n<td>冷冻品可能被提前报废；用 <code>date_basis</code> 显式标语义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>世纪歧义</td>\n<td><code>YYMMDD</code> 的 <code>YY</code> 无法确定 19xx 还是 20xx</td>\n<td>GS1 日期只编码 2 位年</td>\n<td>按滑动窗口（当前年 ±49/50）解析，超出即可疑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缺位/占位</td>\n<td>出现 <code>000000</code>、日位为 <code>00</code> 的 <code>20260700</code></td>\n<td>供应商用 00 表示「未知日」</td>\n<td>GS1 不允许 <code>00</code> 日；判为异常并回溯原始单据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>精度丢失</td>\n<td>只有 <code>MM-YYYY</code>，日被截断</td>\n<td>部分渠道只印到月</td>\n<td>保守取下界（该月 1 日）或上界，取决于业务方向</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>格式陷阱</td>\n<td><code>03/04/2027</code> 读成 3 月 4 日还是 4 月 3 日</td>\n<td>双方 locale 不同</td>\n<td>一律要求 ISO <code>YYYY-MM-DD</code> 或 GS1 <code>YYMMDD</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第 5 类还有隐藏变体：供应商用 Excel 导出时日期被存成序列号（如 <code>46000</code>），不做类型识别就会得到荒谬年份。对策是在解析层先做格式探测（正则 + 范围校验），再进业务校验。</p>\n<p><code>date_basis</code> 字段是治理这堆异常的枢纽：它显式声明「这个日期是生产日、最佳食用期还是到期日」。剩余货架期 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>remain</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>expiry</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>today</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">SL_{\\text{remain}} = d_{\\text{expiry}} - d_{\\text{today}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">remain</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">expiry</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">today</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 只有在 <code>date_basis</code> 明确指向「到期日」时才有业务意义。跨境渠道对剩余货架期有硬门槛：Amazon 要求效期商品在履约中心收货时剩余货架期需留出足够消化时间再加 90 天，并规定效期须以 <code>MM-DD-YYYY</code> 或 <code>MM-YYYY</code> 格式、≥36 号字印在单品与外箱上（Amazon Seller Central，产品包装要求 G200141500 / 效期商品帮助页 201003420）；接近过期（约 50 天内）的库存会被判为待处置。这意味着<strong>效期的单位与格式本身就是合规项</strong>，不只是显示问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"准入校验与异常批次闸门\">准入校验与异常批次闸门</h2><p>把上面所有异常拦在进入可分配池之前，需要一个显式的准入闸门。它对本批次同时跑三类校验，任一失败即置为 <code>QC_HOLD</code>（隔离），而非让脏数据流进 FEFO：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>格式校验</strong>：批号符合来源方约定的正则，日期只接受 <code>YYMMDD</code> 或 ISO 格式，拒绝 <code>00</code> 日与占位串。</li>\n<li><strong>业务校验</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>expiry</mtext></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>production</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{\\text{expiry}} &gt; d_{\\text{production}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">expiry</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">production</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>remain</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">SL_{\\text{remain}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">remain</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 达到平台/品类阈值（Amazon 通道即含 90 天要求）。</li>\n<li><strong>一致性校验</strong>：同一 alias 在不同通道给出的效期是否落在容差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>tol</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_{\\text{tol}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">tol</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 内；超出则标记冲突并触发人工裁决。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>闸门必须与库存状态机打通：隔离中的批次数量仍在台账上，但 <code>status = QC_HOLD</code>、不可分配——这与批次台账里「数量还在、但不可动」的设计同源（见 <a href=\"lot-batch-code-expiry-attribute-model\">批次/批号编码与效期属性建模</a>）。每次人工裁决都应以 <code>confidence = confirmed</code> 回写别名表，让下次同类到货自动通过。</p>\n<p>监管侧的压力正在收紧这条链路。美国 FSMA Section 204 食品安全追溯规则要求受规管主体按关键追溯事件（CTE）记录关键数据元素（KDE），并在 FDA 要求时于 24 小时内提供；合规日期原定 2026 年 1 月 20 日，FDA 提议延后 30 个月至 2028 年 7 月 20 日，且 2026 年的《Continuing Appropriations ... Extensions Act》指示 FDA 在该日期前不予执法（FDA，FSMA 追溯规则页，2026）。药品侧，美国 DSCSA 自 2023 年 11 月 27 日起要求增强的电子化互操作追溯，欧盟要求每盒处方药在配发时扫描并注销唯一标识（EU 2016/161）。这些规则共同把「批次主数据 + 效期」从内部数据质量问题，提升为<strong>必须可审计、可回溯到原始单据</strong>的合规证据链。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结-批次主数据同步的核心是-别名表-外部批号原样保留-规范化只用于比对-内部-lot_id-与外部解耦\">小结- 批次主数据同步的核心是<strong>别名表</strong>：外部批号原样保留、规范化只用于比对、内部 <code>lot_id</code> 与外部解耦。</h2><ul>\n<li>映射有 1:1 / N:1 / 1:N / 冲突四种形态；合并取最早效期、拆分守数量与效期守恒。</li>\n<li>同步必须<strong>幂等 upsert</strong>，自然唯一键建议为 <code>(party_id, external_lot_norm, gtin, valid_from)</code>，并审计「效期是否被改变」。</li>\n<li>效期异常有语义混淆、世纪歧义、缺位占位、精度丢失、格式陷阱五类；<code>date_basis</code> 是治理枢纽，剩余货架期只在语义明确时有意义。</li>\n<li>平台与监管把效期格式和剩余货架期变成合规项：Amazon 要求 <code>MM-DD-YYYY</code>/<code>MM-YYYY</code> 格式与 90 天剩余货架期；FSMA 204、DSCSA、EU 2016/161 要求批次与效期可审计、可回溯。</li>\n<li>用<strong>准入闸门</strong>把异常拦在可分配池之外，隔离批次以 <code>QC_HOLD</code> 进状态机，而非让脏数据污染 FEFO。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"批次主数据同步、供应商批次映射与效期字段异常","id":"批次主数据同步-供应商批次映射与效期字段异常"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：批次主数据同步是一张别名表，不是一次赋值","id":"核心概念-批次主数据同步是一张别名表-不是一次赋值"},{"level":2,"text":"供应商批号到自有批号的映射模型","id":"供应商批号到自有批号的映射模型"},{"level":2,"text":"批次主数据的同步通道与幂等对齐","id":"批次主数据的同步通道与幂等对齐"},{"level":2,"text":"效期字段的异常谱系","id":"效期字段的异常谱系"},{"level":2,"text":"准入校验与异常批次闸门","id":"准入校验与异常批次闸门"},{"level":2,"text":"小结- 批次主数据同步的核心是**别名表**：外部批号原样保留、规范化只用于比对、内部 `lot_id` 与外部解耦。","id":"小结-批次主数据同步的核心是-别名表-外部批号原样保留-规范化只用于比对-内部-lot_id-与外部解耦"}],"prev":{"title":"批次级库存台账与库位映射（批次-库位-数量三元组）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/lot-batch-expiry-fefo-traceability-management/lot-expiry-data-model/lot-level-inventory-ledger-location"},"next":{"title":"FEFO 分配原理与效期优先排序（FEFO/FIFO/LIFO 对照）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/lot-batch-expiry-fefo-traceability-management/fefo-picking-expiry-allocation/fefo-ordering-expiry-priority-principle"}}